<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1302290019"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1706010428"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Happier"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Marshmello / Bastille"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Happier"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:34.290"><div begin="00:00.120" end="03:30.086"><p begin="00:00.120" end="00:03.366" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.120" end="00:00.950">Lately,</span> <span begin="00:01.083" end="00:01.386">I've</span> <span begin="00:01.386" end="00:01.993">been,</span> <span begin="00:01.993" end="00:02.285">I've</span> <span begin="00:02.285" end="00:02.600">been</span> <span begin="00:02.600" end="00:03.366">thinking</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最近 我总是 总是在想</span></p><p begin="00:03.435" end="00:05.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:03.435" end="00:03.768">I</span> <span begin="00:03.768" end="00:04.154">want</span> <span begin="00:04.154" end="00:04.423">you</span> <span begin="00:04.423" end="00:04.670">to</span> <span begin="00:04.670" end="00:05.005">be</span> <span begin="00:05.005" end="00:05.640">happier</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望你能更幸福</span></p><p begin="00:05.809" end="00:08.809" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:05.809" end="00:06.248">I</span> <span begin="00:06.248" end="00:06.611">want</span> <span begin="00:06.611" end="00:06.879">you</span> <span begin="00:06.879" end="00:07.176">to</span> <span begin="00:07.176" end="00:07.462">be</span> <span begin="00:07.462" end="00:08.809">happier</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望你会更快乐</span></p><p begin="00:08.821" end="00:10.413" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:08.821" end="00:08.969">When</span> <span begin="00:08.969" end="00:09.129">the</span> <span begin="00:09.129" end="00:09.736">morning</span> <span begin="00:09.736" end="00:10.413">comes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当晨曦的阳光洒落</span></p><p begin="00:10.628" end="00:12.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:10.628" end="00:10.779">When</span> <span begin="00:10.779" end="00:10.914">we</span> <span begin="00:10.914" end="00:11.271">see</span> <span begin="00:11.271" end="00:11.575">what</span> <span begin="00:11.575" end="00:11.896">we've</span> <span begin="00:11.896" end="00:12.731">become</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着变成如今这般模样的我们</span></p><p begin="00:12.942" end="00:15.328" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:12.942" end="00:13.215">In</span> <span begin="00:13.215" end="00:13.411">the</span> <span begin="00:13.411" end="00:13.655">cold</span> <span begin="00:13.655" end="00:13.881">light</span> <span begin="00:13.881" end="00:13.986">of</span> <span begin="00:13.986" end="00:14.134">day,</span> <span begin="00:14.134" end="00:14.276">we're</span> <span begin="00:14.276" end="00:14.378">a</span> <span begin="00:14.378" end="00:14.623">flame</span> <span begin="00:14.623" end="00:14.803">in</span> <span begin="00:14.803" end="00:14.968">the</span> <span begin="00:14.968" end="00:15.328">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清冷的日光中我们像是风中那摇曳的火焰</span></p><p begin="00:15.328" end="00:17.775" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:15.328" end="00:15.477">Not</span> <span begin="00:15.477" end="00:15.698">the</span> <span begin="00:15.698" end="00:15.980">fire</span> <span begin="00:15.980" end="00:16.284">that</span> <span begin="00:16.284" end="00:16.629">we</span> <span begin="00:16.629" end="00:17.775">begun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们之间已并非最初那激情的火焰</span></p><p begin="00:18.372" end="00:19.911" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:18.372" end="00:18.783">Every</span> <span begin="00:18.783" end="00:19.911">argument</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一次争吵 每个字眼 这一切都已覆水难收</span></p><p begin="00:20.189" end="00:22.342" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:20.189" end="00:20.628">Every</span> <span begin="00:20.628" end="00:20.914">word</span> <span begin="00:20.914" end="00:21.140">we</span> <span begin="00:21.140" end="00:21.533">can't</span> <span begin="00:21.533" end="00:21.836">take</span> <span begin="00:21.836" end="00:22.342">back</span></p><p begin="00:22.528" end="00:23.923" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:22.528" end="00:22.823">'Cause</span> <span begin="00:22.823" end="00:23.072">with</span> <span begin="00:23.072" end="00:23.172">all</span> <span begin="00:23.172" end="00:23.304">that</span> <span begin="00:23.304" end="00:23.429">has</span> <span begin="00:23.429" end="00:23.923">happened</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都已经发生 也无法改变</span></p><p begin="00:23.923" end="00:27.704" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:23.923" end="00:24.043">I</span> <span begin="00:24.043" end="00:24.267">think</span> <span begin="00:24.267" end="00:24.490">that</span> <span begin="00:24.490" end="00:24.663">we</span> <span begin="00:24.663" end="00:24.883">both</span> <span begin="00:24.883" end="00:25.121">know</span> <span begin="00:25.121" end="00:25.311">the</span> <span begin="00:25.311" end="00:25.519">way</span> <span begin="00:25.519" end="00:25.680">that</span> <span begin="00:25.680" end="00:25.780">the</span> <span begin="00:25.780" end="00:26.965">story</span> <span begin="00:26.965" end="00:27.704">ends</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我们都已心知肚明 我们的故事会怎样落幕</span></p><p begin="00:28.560" end="00:31.923" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:28.560" end="00:29.025">Then</span> <span begin="00:29.025" end="00:29.585">only</span> <span begin="00:29.585" end="00:30.078">for</span> <span begin="00:30.078" end="00:30.245">a</span> <span begin="00:30.245" end="00:31.923">minute</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只在刹那间</span></p><p begin="00:32.212" end="00:34.326" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:32.212" end="00:32.459">I</span> <span begin="00:32.459" end="00:32.807">want</span> <span begin="00:32.807" end="00:33.027">to</span> <span begin="00:33.027" end="00:33.426">change</span> <span begin="00:33.426" end="00:33.735">my</span> <span begin="00:33.735" end="00:34.326">mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我决定改变我的心意</span></p><p begin="00:34.333" end="00:37.763" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:34.333" end="00:34.951">'Cause</span> <span begin="00:34.951" end="00:35.266">this</span> <span begin="00:35.266" end="00:35.564">just</span> <span begin="00:35.564" end="00:35.897">don't</span> <span begin="00:35.897" end="00:36.224">feel</span> <span begin="00:36.224" end="00:36.813">right</span> <span begin="00:36.813" end="00:37.449">to</span> <span begin="00:37.449" end="00:37.763">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我不愿继续错下去</span></p><p begin="00:38.185" end="00:41.592" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:38.185" end="00:38.572">I</span> <span begin="00:38.572" end="00:39.204">wanna</span> <span begin="00:39.204" end="00:39.506">raise</span> <span begin="00:39.506" end="00:39.798">your</span> <span begin="00:39.798" end="00:41.592">spirits</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望你不再消沉</span></p><p begin="00:41.769" end="00:44.358" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:41.769" end="00:41.994">I</span> <span begin="00:41.994" end="00:42.308">want</span> <span begin="00:42.308" end="00:42.586">to</span> <span begin="00:42.586" end="00:43.027">see</span> <span begin="00:43.027" end="00:43.205">you</span> <span begin="00:43.205" end="00:43.894">smile,</span> <span begin="00:43.894" end="00:44.358">but</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望见你重展笑颜</span></p><p begin="00:44.465" end="00:47.678" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:44.465" end="00:44.887">Know</span> <span begin="00:44.887" end="00:45.194">that</span> <span begin="00:45.194" end="00:45.552">means</span> <span begin="00:45.552" end="00:45.855">I'll</span> <span begin="00:45.855" end="00:46.456">have</span> <span begin="00:46.456" end="00:47.069">to</span> <span begin="00:47.069" end="00:47.678">leave</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也明白 我的离去已成定局</span></p><p begin="00:54.055" end="00:57.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:54.055" end="00:54.447">Know</span> <span begin="00:54.447" end="00:54.706">that</span> <span begin="00:54.706" end="00:55.077">means</span> <span begin="00:55.077" end="00:55.477">I'll</span> <span begin="00:55.477" end="00:55.951">have</span> <span begin="00:55.951" end="00:56.498">to</span> <span begin="00:56.498" end="00:57.371">leave</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也明白 我的离去已成定局</span></p><p begin="00:57.630" end="01:00.847" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:57.630" end="00:58.228">Lately,</span> <span begin="00:58.560" end="00:58.877">I've</span> <span begin="00:58.877" end="00:59.375">been,</span> <span begin="00:59.493" end="00:59.776">I've</span> <span begin="00:59.776" end="01:00.077">been</span> <span begin="01:00.077" end="01:00.847">thinking</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最近 我总是 总是在想</span></p><p begin="01:01.012" end="01:03.166" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:01.012" end="01:01.182">I</span> <span begin="01:01.182" end="01:01.628">want</span> <span begin="01:01.628" end="01:01.911">you</span> <span begin="01:01.911" end="01:02.193">to</span> <span begin="01:02.193" end="01:02.511">be</span> <span begin="01:02.511" end="01:03.166">happier</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望你能更幸福</span></p><p begin="01:03.369" end="01:06.357" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:03.369" end="01:03.596">I</span> <span begin="01:03.596" end="01:03.987">want</span> <span begin="01:03.987" end="01:04.347">you</span> <span begin="01:04.347" end="01:04.591">to</span> <span begin="01:04.591" end="01:04.871">be</span> <span begin="01:04.871" end="01:06.357">happier</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望你会更快乐</span></p><p begin="01:06.357" end="01:08.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:06.357" end="01:06.594">When</span> <span begin="01:06.594" end="01:06.761">the</span> <span begin="01:06.761" end="01:07.338">evening</span> <span begin="01:07.338" end="01:08.000">falls</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜幕降临</span></p><p begin="01:08.174" end="01:10.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:08.174" end="01:08.392">And</span> <span begin="01:08.392" end="01:08.600">I'm</span> <span begin="01:08.600" end="01:08.880">left</span> <span begin="01:08.880" end="01:09.195">there</span> <span begin="01:09.195" end="01:09.505">with</span> <span begin="01:09.505" end="01:09.820">my</span> <span begin="01:09.820" end="01:10.304">thoughts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心事重重的离开</span></p><p begin="01:10.476" end="01:12.937" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:10.476" end="01:10.802">And</span> <span begin="01:10.802" end="01:10.981">the</span> <span begin="01:10.981" end="01:11.460">image</span> <span begin="01:11.460" end="01:11.641">of</span> <span begin="01:11.641" end="01:11.861">you</span> <span begin="01:11.861" end="01:12.178">being</span> <span begin="01:12.178" end="01:12.409">with</span> <span begin="01:12.409" end="01:12.742">someone</span> <span begin="01:12.742" end="01:12.937">else</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想象着其他人陪伴在你身边的画面</span></p><p begin="01:12.950" end="01:15.803" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:12.950" end="01:13.104">Well,</span> <span begin="01:13.104" end="01:13.336">it's</span> <span begin="01:13.336" end="01:13.758">eating</span> <span begin="01:13.758" end="01:13.954">me</span> <span begin="01:13.954" end="01:14.264">up</span> <span begin="01:14.264" end="01:15.035">in</span><span begin="01:15.035" end="01:15.803">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好吧 这想法已将我彻底吞噬</span></p><p begin="01:16.007" end="01:17.573" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:16.007" end="01:16.207">But</span> <span begin="01:16.207" end="01:16.374">we</span> <span begin="01:16.374" end="01:16.666">ran</span> <span begin="01:16.666" end="01:16.981">our</span> <span begin="01:16.981" end="01:17.573">course</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我们继续各自的生活</span></p><p begin="01:17.737" end="01:19.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:17.737" end="01:18.059">We</span> <span begin="01:18.059" end="01:18.826">pretended</span> <span begin="01:18.826" end="01:19.148">we're</span> <span begin="01:19.148" end="01:19.890">okay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假装我们相安无事</span></p><p begin="01:20.085" end="01:21.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:20.085" end="01:20.298">Now</span> <span begin="01:20.298" end="01:20.459">if</span> <span begin="01:20.459" end="01:20.697">we</span> <span begin="01:20.697" end="01:20.917">jump</span> <span begin="01:20.917" end="01:21.500">together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但如果我们能一起纵身跃入海洋</span></p><p begin="01:21.510" end="01:25.053" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:21.510" end="01:21.722">At</span> <span begin="01:21.722" end="01:21.922">least</span> <span begin="01:21.922" end="01:22.071">we</span> <span begin="01:22.071" end="01:22.255">can</span> <span begin="01:22.255" end="01:22.522">swim</